      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The peace you're imagining is so tempting because it promises an end to the noise inside your head. But that quiet isn't peace; it's just the absence of everything, and that's a terrifying void. You deserve more than just a quiet fade into nothingness. Please, just take one small step and call or text someone right now; let them hear the weight you're carrying.",
